  "Select dropdown option for interactive element index by the text of the option you want to select:
{select_dropdown_option: {'intent': {'type': 'purpose of this action', 'optional': true}, 'index': {'type': 'index of the dropdown element', 'required': true}, 'text': {'type': 'text of the option', 'required': true}}}",
  "Attach a file to a file input (<input type=file>) by index. Provide the file name and its full text content; use it for forms that require an upload:
